    "OAUTH-14 Bounded scheduled retention preserves every code/refresh hash of retained families, keeps terminal connection identity for at least seven days after the conservative terminal/last-use anchor, deletes only orphan expired requests and protects live clients/pending authorization. SKIP LOCKED, hard100cap, real self-FK cascade, idempotence, scheduler rollback/continuation and immediate post-decision redaction pass isolated PostgreSQL tests.": "pass",
